er":false,"text":"He has a gloomy aura and spends most of his time holed up in the science preparation room."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is mostly ignored by the students."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a surprisingly good physique."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"When he was in high school, he was bullied by Jounouchi and his group until Hiiragi's sister intervened."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Later, he joined Jounouchi's group and took part in the rapes of Hiiragi's sister."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5347"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a34ace69662783e7acca9b8a80b04162e6c5555959ab720d2bf878c0cb45316.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a90b694b88ba744283efd5348a3dea3d0abb8cc2061372428d7adf62cb69a21.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5348","characterName":"城之内 知幸","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5348"},"originalCharacterName":"城之内 知幸","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Physics teacher."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has been a classmate of Tanemo Shigeru since their school days."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a black belt in judo."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is quite popular with the students as a teacher who is easy to talk to."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"When he was in high school, he was the leader of the group that bullied the student Hiiragi's sister had helped."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"After Hiiragi's sister intervened, he and his group began bullying and raping her."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He is also the murderer of Raika's brother."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5348"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadat